<title>SINGAPORE: SingTel incorporates new subsidiary.</title>
<headline>SingTel incorporates new subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Telecommunications Ltd (SingTel) said on Monday that it had incorporated a wholly-owned subsidiary SingTelSat Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>It said the principal activity of the company was that of an investment holding, with an authorised capital of Singapore $500 million and the paid-up capital S$2.</p>
<p>SingTel gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
